Mishkefet bundles or downloads the following third-party material.

Handwriting recognition model
-----------------------------
itayinbar/Mishkefet-v1                          CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
  https://huggingface.co/itayinbar/Mishkefet-v1
  Trained on, among others, BiblIA (CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0), Pinkas (CC-BY-4.0),
  DiffusionPen Hebrew (CC-BY-4.0), HHD (CC-BY-3.0) and Teklia line datasets;
  the language models are built from Hebrew Wikipedia (CC-BY-SA). See the
  model card for the full list. The NonCommercial-ShareAlike terms of the
  weights apply to this app: it is free and has no ads.
  The iPhone app bundles the ONNX files; the web app downloads them from the
  Hugging Face CDN at runtime.

